    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the entertainment head end equipment rack front, showing the partitions, the stowage closure, the rack front hardware and the seat display interface panels.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the entertainment head end equipment rack front. Use it to order partitions, rack front hardware and the seat display interface panels.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows the rack front with the chassis removed. Item 10 is the ventilated upper partition used with the second generation chassis and item 10A is the seat track cover fitted at the same position on aircraft that have not been converted. Do not fit the second generation chassis against item 10A; the rack will run above its outlet temperature limit at full cabin load. The rack is fitted on the upper deck only."
    },
